<title>UK: SOCCER-SWEDE LARSSON SIGNS FOR CELTIC.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SWEDE LARSSON SIGNS FOR CELTIC.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Celtic made their second signing in two days on Friday when 25-year-old Swedish international striker Henrik Larsson joined them from Feyenoord for 610,000 pounds ($1 million).</p>
<p>The premier division club signed Scottish international defender Craig Burley from England premier league Chelsea for 2.5 million sterling ($4.2 million) on Thursday.</p>
